{
  "id": "atlassian-tasks-assigned",
  "title": "Tasks Assigned",
  "description": "Tile: Tasks Assigned - Jira (WorkQ ask: 'a simple list of tasks/work that is assigned to you in Jira'). JQL `assignee = currentUser() AND statusCategory != Done ORDER BY priority DESC` -- assigned-to-me only (unlike this plugin's Open Service Requests tile, which deliberately also includes unassigned work), excluding Done/closed-category statuses, highest priority first. On a shared/admin connection this reflects whoever connected Jira, not necessarily the tenant as a whole -- same caveat as Tasks Due Today. Each row shows the work item's key + title (Work) and its reporter (via `atlassian_display_name`, falling back to 'Unassigned' if somehow reporter-less) directly in the list per the ticket's explicit ask, plus a priority dot (`atlassian_priority_tone`). Clicking a row opens an overlay with the full popup detail set requested: Assignee, Reporter, Priority, Status, Resolution, Created, Updated, and the Project (space) it belongs to, plus an 'Open Jira' link -- mirroring Open Service Requests' exact click-through mechanics (state captured via `$computed`-wrapped `$item` values, since a bare `$item` inside an action param resolves to a state path, not its value). Created/Updated are formatted at click time via `format_date` (`dd-mmm-yy` per TILE-DISPLAY-STANDARDS.md #1). **Known gap, carried over from Open Service Requests/Service Desk Queue, not new to this tile:** `atlassian_issue_url` returns a fixed, tenant-agnostic `https://home.atlassian.com` (no dataProvider-chaining support to resolve a real per-tenant site domain), so the overlay's hint tells the viewer to search the issue key once there rather than deep-linking -- the same honest trade-off already accepted on this plugin's other tiles. The Project field is shown as plain text (name + key), not a second fabricated link, for the same reason. The Resolution field (`fields/resolution/name`, null on any still-open issue -- expected to be most rows here, since Done-category work is excluded) goes through a new `atlassian_resolution_label` helper added alongside this tile, mirroring `atlassian_priority_label`'s 'No priority' fallback, so it reads 'Unresolved' rather than blank. Confirmed live in the tile harness against real sandbox data (KAN-1 'Task 1', KAN-3 'Subtask 2.1', both reported by Sean Baker) -- list, sort order, and all 8 popup fields render correctly. The overlay's 'Open Jira' button could not be click-tested in the harness itself -- the harness deliberately doesn't wire MyHub's system-level actions (`open_url` included; see `tile-harness/harness/src/system.tsx`), only MCP-tool actions, so this is a harness gap affecting every tile using `open_url` (including the already-published Open Service Requests/Service Desk Queue tiles), not something specific to this one. Built entirely on the existing `search_issues` tool -- no new server-side MCP tool needed.",
  "category": "work-management",
  "tags": ["atlassian", "jira", "tasks", "issues", "assigned", "priority", "project-management"],
  "keywords": ["jira tasks assigned", "my tasks", "assigned to me", "priority sort", "work items", "reporter"],
  "connectorsUsed": ["atlassian"],
  "popularity": 0,
  "sizing": {
    "preferred": { "colSpan": 4, "rowSpan": 6 },
    "min": { "colSpan": 3, "rowSpan": 4 },
    "max": { "colSpan": 8, "rowSpan": 10 }
  },
  "dataProvider": {
    "mcp": "atlassian",
    "tool": "search_issues",
    "params": {
      "jql": "assignee = currentUser() AND statusCategory != Done ORDER BY priority DESC",
      "max_results": 20,
      "fields": ["summary", "reporter", "assignee", "priority", "status", "resolution", "created", "updated", "project"]
    }
  },
  "spec": {
    "root": "card",
    "elements": {
      "card": {
        "type": "Card",
        "props": {},
        "children": ["header", "body", "overlay"]
      },
      "header": {
        "type": "Header",
        "props": {},
        "children": ["headerRow"]
      },
      "headerRow": {
        "type": "Row",
        "props": { "gap": "sm", "align": "start", "justify": "between" },
        "children": ["titleGroup", "countBadge"]
      },
      "titleGroup": {
        "type": "Row",
        "props": { "gap": "sm", "align": "start" },
        "children": ["titleIcon", "titleStack"]
      },
      "titleIcon": {
        "type": "Icon",
        "props": { "name": "ClipboardCheck", "tone": "accent", "size": "sm" }
      },
      "titleStack": {
        "type": "Stack",
        "props": { "gap": "none" },
        "children": ["title", "subtitle"]
      },
      "title": {
        "type": "Heading",
        "props": { "text": "Tasks Assigned", "level": "h2" }
      },
      "subtitle": {
        "type": "Eyebrow",
        "props": { "text": "Jira · Assigned to me, sorted by priority" }
      },
      "countBadge": {
        "type": "Badge",
        "props": {
          "text": {
            "$computed": "fmt",
            "args": {
              "pattern": "{n} assigned",
              "n": {
                "$computed": "count",
                "args": { "value": { "$state": "/atlassian/search_issues/issues" } }
              }
            }
          },
          "tone": "muted",
          "variant": "soft"
        }
      },
      "body": {
        "type": "Body",
        "props": {},
        "children": ["loading", "empty", "taskList"]
      },
      "loading": {
        "type": "Stack",
        "props": { "gap": "sm" },
        "children": ["sk1", "sk2", "sk3", "sk4"],
        "visible": { "$state": "/_loading/atlassian.search_issues" }
      },
      "sk1": { "type": "Skeleton", "props": { "height": "2.5rem", "rounded": "md" } },
      "sk2": { "type": "Skeleton", "props": { "height": "2.5rem", "rounded": "md" } },
      "sk3": { "type": "Skeleton", "props": { "height": "2.5rem", "rounded": "md" } },
      "sk4": { "type": "Skeleton", "props": { "height": "2.5rem", "rounded": "md" } },
      "empty": {
        "type": "Empty",
        "props": { "message": "No open tasks assigned to you." },
        "visible": {
          "$and": [
            { "$state": "/_loading/atlassian.search_issues", "not": true },
            { "$state": "/atlassian/search_issues/issues/0", "not": true }
          ]
        }
      },
      "taskList": {
        "type": "Stack",
        "props": { "gap": "xs" },
        "children": ["taskRow"],
        "repeat": { "statePath": "/atlassian/search_issues/issues", "key": "id" },
        "visible": {
          "$and": [
            { "$state": "/_loading/atlassian.search_issues", "not": true },
            { "$state": "/atlassian/search_issues/issues/0" }
          ]
        }
      },
      "taskRow": {
        "type": "Row",
        "props": { "gap": "sm", "align": "start", "hover": true, "clickable": true },
        "children": ["taskDot", "taskStack"],
        "on": {
          "click": [
            {
              "action": "setState",
              "params": {
                "statePath": "/ui/sel/key",
                "value": { "$computed": "identity", "args": { "value": { "$item": "key" } } }
              }
            },
            {
              "action": "setState",
              "params": {
                "statePath": "/ui/sel/summary",
                "value": { "$computed": "identity", "args": { "value": { "$item": "fields/summary" } } }
              }
            },
            {
              "action": "setState",
              "params": {
                "statePath": "/ui/sel/status",
                "value": { "$computed": "identity", "args": { "value": { "$item": "fields/status/name" } } }
              }
            },
            {
              "action": "setState",
              "params": {
                "statePath": "/ui/sel/reporter",
                "value": {
                  "$computed": "atlassian_display_name",
                  "args": { "person": { "$item": "fields/reporter" } }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "action": "setState",
              "params": {
                "statePath": "/ui/sel/assignee",
                "value": {
                  "$computed": "atlassian_display_name",
                  "args": { "person": { "$item": "fields/assignee" } }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "action": "setState",
              "params": {
                "statePath": "/ui/sel/priorityLabel",
                "value": {
                  "$computed": "atlassian_priority_label",
                  "args": { "value": { "$item": "fields/priority/name" } }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "action": "setState",
              "params": {
                "statePath": "/ui/sel/resolution",
                "value": {
                  "$computed": "atlassian_resolution_label",
                  "args": { "value": { "$item": "fields/resolution/name" } }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "action": "setState",
              "params": {
                "statePath": "/ui/sel/created",
                "value": {
                  "$computed": "format_date",
                  "args": { "value": { "$item": "fields/created" }, "format": "dd-mmm-yy" }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "action": "setState",
              "params": {
                "statePath": "/ui/sel/updated",
                "value": {
                  "$computed": "format_date",
                  "args": { "value": { "$item": "fields/updated" }, "format": "dd-mmm-yy" }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "action": "setState",
              "params": {
                "statePath": "/ui/sel/project",
                "value": {
                  "$computed": "fmt",
                  "args": {
                    "pattern": "{name} ({key})",
                    "name": { "$item": "fields/project/name" },
                    "key": { "$item": "fields/project/key" }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "action": "setState",
              "params": {
                "statePath": "/ui/sel/issueUrl",
                "value": { "$computed": "atlassian_issue_url", "args": {} }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "taskDot": {
        "type": "Dot",
        "props": {
          "tone": {
            "$computed": "atlassian_priority_tone",
            "args": { "value": { "$item": "fields/priority/name" } }
          },
          "size": "sm"
        }
      },
      "taskStack": {
        "type": "Stack",
        "props": { "gap": "none", "grow": true },
        "children": ["taskKey", "taskSummary", "taskReporter"]
      },
      "taskKey": {
        "type": "Caption",
        "props": { "text": { "$item": "key" } }
      },
      "taskSummary": {
        "type": "Text",
        "props": { "text": { "$item": "fields/summary" }, "size": "sm", "weight": "medium", "truncate": true }
      },
      "taskReporter": {
        "type": "Caption",
        "props": {
          "text": {
            "$computed": "fmt",
            "args": {
              "pattern": "Reported by {reporter}",
              "reporter": {
                "$computed": "atlassian_display_name",
                "args": { "person": { "$item": "fields/reporter" } }
              }
            }
          },
          "tone": "muted"
        }
      },
      "overlay": {
        "type": "Overlay",
        "props": { "maxWidth": "28rem" },
        "visible": { "$state": "/ui/sel/key" },
        "on": {
          "backdropClick": { "action": "setState", "params": { "statePath": "/ui/sel/key", "value": "" } }
        },
        "children": ["ovStack"]
      },
      "ovStack": {
        "type": "Stack",
        "props": { "gap": "md" },
        "children": [
          "ovHeader",
          "ovDivider",
          "ovStatus",
          "ovReporter",
          "ovAssignee",
          "ovPriority",
          "ovResolution",
          "ovCreated",
          "ovUpdated",
          "ovProject",
          "ovDivider2",
          "ovActions"
        ]
      },
      "ovHeader": {
        "type": "Row",
        "props": { "justify": "between", "align": "start", "gap": "sm" },
        "children": ["ovTitleStack", "ovClose"]
      },
      "ovTitleStack": {
        "type": "Stack",
        "props": { "gap": "none", "grow": true },
        "children": ["ovTitle", "ovSubtitle"]
      },
      "ovTitle": {
        "type": "Heading",
        "props": { "text": { "$state": "/ui/sel/summary" }, "level": "h3", "wrap": true }
      },
      "ovSubtitle": {
        "type": "Caption",
        "props": { "text": { "$state": "/ui/sel/key" } }
      },
      "ovClose": {
        "type": "OverlayClose",
        "props": { "ariaLabel": "Close task details" },
        "on": {
          "click": { "action": "setState", "params": { "statePath": "/ui/sel/key", "value": "" } }
        }
      },
      "ovDivider": { "type": "Divider", "props": {} },
      "ovStatus": {
        "type": "KeyValue",
        "props": { "label": "Status", "value": { "$state": "/ui/sel/status" } }
      },
      "ovReporter": {
        "type": "KeyValue",
        "props": { "label": "Reporter", "value": { "$state": "/ui/sel/reporter" } }
      },
      "ovAssignee": {
        "type": "KeyValue",
        "props": { "label": "Assignee", "value": { "$state": "/ui/sel/assignee" } }
      },
      "ovPriority": {
        "type": "KeyValue",
        "props": { "label": "Priority", "value": { "$state": "/ui/sel/priorityLabel" } }
      },
      "ovResolution": {
        "type": "KeyValue",
        "props": { "label": "Resolution", "value": { "$state": "/ui/sel/resolution" } }
      },
      "ovCreated": {
        "type": "KeyValue",
        "props": { "label": "Created", "value": { "$state": "/ui/sel/created" } }
      },
      "ovUpdated": {
        "type": "KeyValue",
        "props": { "label": "Updated", "value": { "$state": "/ui/sel/updated" } }
      },
      "ovProject": {
        "type": "KeyValue",
        "props": { "label": "Project", "value": { "$state": "/ui/sel/project" } }
      },
      "ovDivider2": { "type": "Divider", "props": {} },
      "ovActions": {
        "type": "Row",
        "props": { "justify": "between", "align": "center", "gap": "sm" },
        "children": ["ovHint", "ovOpenBtn"]
      },
      "ovHint": {
        "type": "Caption",
        "props": {
          "text": {
            "$computed": "fmt",
            "args": { "pattern": "Search {key} once there", "key": { "$state": "/ui/sel/key" } }
          },
          "tone": "muted"
        }
      },
      "ovOpenBtn": {
        "type": "Button",
        "props": { "label": "Open Jira", "variant": "primary", "size": "sm", "leadingIcon": "ExternalLink" },
        "on": {
          "click": { "action": "open_url", "params": { "url": { "$state": "/ui/sel/issueUrl" }, "target": "_blank" } }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "status": "published"
}
